---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">THE STUDIO</p>
      <h2>Two perspectives.<br /><span>One vision.</span></h2>
    </div>

    <p class="section-note">
      B&E RollTech brings photography, editing, and technology<br />
      together through thoughtful visual work.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-image">
      <img
        src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/cd/a7/5a/cda75a26b8f2f2fc9b07f08bdd321657.jpg"
        alt="Creative studio workspace"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="about-lead">
        We are a creative duo turning simple ideas and raw concepts into
        considered immaculate reality.
      </p>

      <p>
        Our approach combines visual sensitivity with technical precision.
        We explore composition, atmosphere, and detail while using modern
        digital tools to give every ideas and concepts clarity and purpose.
      </p>

      <div class="about-details">
        <div>
          <span>FOCUS</span>
          <p>UX/UI <br />Photo editing</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 7%;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-image {
    height: 520px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #dedbd5;
  }

  .about-image img {
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-copy {
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .about-copy > p {
    color: #77756f;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .about-copy .about-lead {
    color: #222220;
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .about-details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    border-top: 1px solid #d4d1ca;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 22px;
  }

  .about-details span {
    color: #929089;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .about-details p {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .about-image {
      height: 420px;
    }
  }
</style>